{"last_link_id": 121, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "links": [61, 112], "label": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "type": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "localized_name": "VOXCPM_MODEL"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [-930, 1160], "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM-0.5B", "no_fullgraph", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "optimize"}, "name": "optimize", "label": "optimize", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "optimize"}, {"widget": {"name": "load_denoiser"}, "name": "load_denoiser", "label": "load_denoiser", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "load_denoiser"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "VoxCPM_Loader", "properties": {"ver": "b900d72048c1dc590fc5e97e36a01583daad55e1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "judian17/ComfyUI-SRT-subtitles-VoxCPM", "Node name for S&R": "VoxCPM_Loader"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM loader节点的optimize参数用于启用torch compiler。注意windows需要先安装cudatoolkit和visual studio duild tool。具体安装方式可参考：\nhttps://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YZ2ZYGETB\n\nnone代表不编译，no_fullgraph代表不使用fullgraph参数，因为启用此参数最终速度更快但是需要在启动前将cuda内存分配方案由异步分配器改为pytorch原生分配器。若使用异步分配器会报错：\nRuntimeError: cudaMallocAsync does not yet support checkPoolLiveAllocations. If you need it, please file an issue describing your use case.\nfullgraph参数代表启用fullgraph参数。需要启动前cuda内存分配方案由异步分配器改为pytorch原生分配器。三种方案同参数下速度耗时如下：\nnone : 加载4.83 推理 42.6,清理缓存后第二次加载4.612.推理40.27\nno_fullgraph ; 加载11.58，推理 21.9,清理缓存后第二次加载4.612.推理19.99\nno_fullgraph : 加载第一次12.6，推理14.3，清理缓存后第二次加载5.75，推理13.96\n秋叶包可在选项面板切换为同步分配器，其他启动器请在启动代码后加上 --disable-cuda-malloc，例如 python main.py --disable-cuda-malloc\n\nload_denoiser控制是否加载降噪模型，开启加载耗时更长些。\n\n\nVoxCPM cache builder的speaker_name 为手动输入说话人编号，与srt文件中每句话前对应的说话人一致。文本输入框中输入参考音频的说话内容。输出的voxcpm_cache 连接到vocpm cache combiner节点，此节点可以复制不断串联以增加说话人。第一个节点的cache_group不需要输入，后续每一个的输入与前一个输出相连，最后一个连到srt processor节点。srt字幕中的每句话前请使用 字符串+空格的格式区分说话人，例如：\n1\n00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000\nspeaker1 Hello world！\n\n2\n00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,000\n说话人 你好，世界！\n\n当想处理单人srt字幕时，srt字幕中文本不需要加说话人前缀。例如：\n1\n00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000\nHello world！\n\n2\n00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,000\n你好，世界！\n\n可使用 comfyui \"加载音频\"节点加载参考音频输入给cache builder节点，也可加载完整长音频，输入给 audio trimmer by timestamp节点，在节点上输入形如00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,000的时间戳文本，即可仅输出此时间段的音频。\n\nnormalize text参数用于正则化文本，例如输入数字50时，不开启可能会读成五零，开启可读成五十。\n\nstretch method的三种模式：\n  none代表不加速音频，当生成音频超出原始时间段长度，与下一句重合时，两句话会同时存在；\n  librosa 代表使用librosa加速音频使其长度与文本时长一致。此加速方法效果时好时坏，可通过调整stretch n fft与 stretch hop length来改善“金属声”等效果。\n  pydub 代表使用pydub方法加速音频使其长度与文本时长一致。此方法效果略好于librosa，但需要下载ffmpeg并设置环境变量，本方法本质是借助ffmpeg处理音频。ffmpeg安装及环境变量设置可参考此处：https://blog.csdn.net/Natsuago/article/details/143231558\n\nkeep model loaded开启则运行后保留显存占用，关闭则清理显存。但是我时间与技术受限，当前无法完全清理，剩下1G怎么也清理不掉，不过使用comfyui manager 节点的free model and node cache按钮可以手动清空一部分，还会剩余0.3g清不掉。希望有社区大佬优化吧。\n\n\n默认CFG=2比较正常一些，较大的CFG虽然在某些情况下能够提升生成的following效果，但是会导致潜在的不稳定性，详情可见项目作者的技术报告中关于CFG的实验部分：https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.24650\n\ninference timesteps 10步即可有较好效果，增加步数可得到更好的效果\n\nretry_threshold (重试阈值):这是触发重试的条件。voxcpm 会比较生成音频的长度和输入文本的长度。如果生成的音频相对于文本来说“过长”，模型就认为自己“卡住”了（即在“胡言乱语”）。如果参考音频为一个语速非常慢的说话人（例如戏剧性的停顿）生成语音，可能需要调高这个值（比如到 8.0 或 10.0），以防止模型误以为正常的慢速语音是“坏”的。\nretry_max_attempts (最大重试次数):这是在触发“坏情况”后，模型允许自己重试多少次。当 audio_text_ratio 超过 retry_threshold 时，模型会丢弃这一次生成的坏音频，并从头开始（使用不同的随机性）为同一句文本再次尝试生成。\n\n何时调整： 默认值 3 通常足够了。如果设为 0，则会禁用此功能（即使检测到坏情况也不会重试）。\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [614.5590209960938, 319.3681640625], "pos": [268.1080017089844, 308.15484619140625], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [106], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [291.7779235839844, 58], "pos": [-960, 980], "widgets_values": ["00:00:00,441  --> 00:00:27,060"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 103, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "timestamp"}, "name": "timestamp", "label": "timestamp", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "timestamp"}], "flags": {}, "id": 59, "type": "Audio_Trimmer_By_Timestamp", "properties": {"ver": "b900d72048c1dc590fc5e97e36a01583daad55e1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "judian17/ComfyUI-SRT-subtitles-VoxCPM", "Node name for S&R": "Audio_Trimmer_By_Timestamp"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CACHE_GROUP", "links": [119], "label": "CACHE_GROUP", "type": "CACHE_GROUP", "localized_name": "CACHE_GROUP"}], "size": [279.5611267089844, 46], "pos": [-33.27482604980469, 1093.657958984375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "cache_item", "link": 72, "label": "cache_item", "type": "VOXCPM_CACHE", "localized_name": "cache_item"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "cache_group", "label": "cache_group", "type": "CACHE_GROUP", "localized_name": "cache_group"}], "flags": {}, "id": 47, "type": "VoxCPM_Cache_Combiner", "properties": {"ver": "b900d72048c1dc590fc5e97e36a01583daad55e1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "judian17/ComfyUI-SRT-subtitles-VoxCPM", "Node name for S&R": "VoxCPM_Cache_Combiner"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VOXCPM_CACHE", "links": [72], "label": "VOXCPM_CACHE", "type": "VOXCPM_CACHE", "localized_name": "VOXCPM_CACHE"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-530, 1090], "widgets_values": ["speaker2 ", "我发现，人生想要成功，只要做到两件事：一是不做愚蠢的事，二是活得久。做到这两点，你一定是人生赢家。\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 61, "label": "model", "type": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "prompt_audio", "link": 106, "label": "prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "speaker_name"}, "name": "speaker_name", "label": "speaker_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "speaker_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_text"}, "name": "prompt_text", "label": "prompt_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 40, "type": "VoxCPM_Cache_Builder", "properties": {"ver": "b900d72048c1dc590fc5e97e36a01583daad55e1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "judian17/ComfyUI-SRT-subtitles-VoxCPM", "Node name for S&R": "VoxCPM_Cache_Builder"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [103], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [-980, 790], "widgets_values": ["3a77d649ee202029718bdac2943ea903e303d28e555ecf7fcfbb629b07f3368a.flac", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "LoadAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.66", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [300, 140], "pos": [752.4072875976562, 690.3419189453125], "widgets_values": ["audio/voxcpm"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 113, "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.66", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [113], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [418.7144775390625, 519.7459716796875], "pos": [280, 710], "widgets_values": ["\n1\n00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,500\n我要分享给你所有的金钱法则，让你无需天赋、\n\n2\n00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,200\n运气或信托基金也能致富。\n\n3\n00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,500\n一旦学会并应用这些法则，你就能开始疯狂搞钱。\n\n4\n00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,800\n在这个视频里，我会告诉你这些法则究竟是什么，\n\n5\n00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:19,500\n以及我是如何从24岁一贫如洗，到27岁成为百万富翁，\n\n6\n00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,500\n如今身价超过1亿美元的。\n\n7\n00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,800\n规则一：4%法则。\n\n8\n00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:28,500\n你心里得有个数，如果你存够了这个数，\n\n9\n00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,200\n你就能完全靠被动收入生活。\n\n10\n00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,500\n我知道这听起来很无聊，但真正的富有意味着自由。\n\n11\n00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,800\n自由意味着你不需要工作。\n\n12\n00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:40,500\n我是指安全、简单、有保障，不整虚的。\n\n13\n00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:44,200\n只要有了这笔钱，剩下的都是锦上添花。\n\n14\n00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,500\n4%法则超级简单。\n\n15\n00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:50,000\n拿你想要的年收入来说，假设是10万美元，\n\n16\n00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,500\n然后把它除以0.04。\n\n17\n00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,800\n算出来的就是你需要存的钱，这样你就能轻松生活。\n\n18\n00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,500\n听起来很疯狂，像是一大笔钱，但其实不然。\n\n19\n00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:03,500\n因为如果你投资理财，利用复利增长，并且尽早开始，\n\n20\n00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:05,800\n你可以很简单地达到那个目标。\n\n21\n00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:08,500\n既然知道了要存多少钱，\n\n22\n00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,000\n那到底该怎么赚到这笔钱呢？\n\n23\n00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,800\n规则二：掌握一项高收入技能。\n\n24\n00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:16,500\n如果你已经知道怎么赚那么多钱，你早就赚到了。\n\n25\n00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:19,800\n这意味着你必须投资自己，开发一项世界看重的技能。\n\n26\n00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:23,500\n这就是为什么它叫高收入技能，\n\n27\n00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:26,500\n也就是人们愿意花大价钱买你的时间来做这项工作。\n\n28\n00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:30,500\n最棒的是，每个人都能获得同样的工具和信息，\n\n29\n00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:36,000\n只是大多数人假装自己解决不了这个问题罢了。\n```", true, "librosa", 320, 8, true, 2.5, 30, 936, "fixed", 3, 6], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 112, "label": "model", "type": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "cache_group", "link": 119, "label": "cache_group", "type": "CACHE_GROUP", "localized_name": "cache_group"}, {"widget": {"name": "srt_text"}, "name": "srt_text", "label": "srt_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "srt_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "normalize_text"}, "name": "normalize_text", "label": "normalize_text", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "normalize_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "stretch_method"}, "name": "stretch_method", "label": "stretch_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "stretch_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "stretch_n_fft"}, "name": "stretch_n_fft", "label": "stretch_n_fft", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "stretch_n_fft"}, {"widget": {"name": "stretch_hop_length"}, "name": "stretch_hop_length", "label": "stretch_hop_length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "stretch_hop_length"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_value"}, "name": "cfg_value", "label": "cfg_value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_value"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_timesteps"}, "name": "inference_timesteps", "label": "inference_timesteps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inference_timesteps"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "retry_max_attempts"}, "name": "retry_max_attempts", "label": "retry_max_attempts", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "retry_max_attempts"}, {"widget": {"name": "retry_threshold"}, "name": "retry_threshold", "label": "retry_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "retry_threshold"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "VoxCPM_SRT_Processor", "properties": {"ver": "b900d72048c1dc590fc5e97e36a01583daad55e1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "judian17/ComfyUI-SRT-subtitles-VoxCPM", "Node name for S&R": "VoxCPM_SRT_Processor"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.28.8", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-116.51171422401657, -513.3696055133139], "scale": 0.9646149645000038}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "generate audio by srt-subtitles and reference audio", "bounding": [-1010, 150, 2078.491455078125, 1126.892578125]}], "links": [[61, 35, 0, 40, 0, "VOXCPM_MODEL"], [72, 40, 0, 47, 0, "VOXCPM_CACHE"], [103, 58, 0, 59, 0, "AUDIO"], [106, 59, 0, 40, 1, "AUDIO"], [112, 35, 0, 65, 0, "VOXCPM_MODEL"], [113, 65, 0, 15, 0, "AUDIO"], [119, 47, 0, 65, 1, "CACHE_GROUP"]], "id": "1be99ed8-635c-408f-8e0c-5e23567ce902", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 76, "revision": 0}